  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Improve democratic governance and stability, including increasing women&#x2019;s political representation, which will provide an enabling environment for Kenya&#x2019;s prosperity, development and poverty reduction.   This programme seeks to promote an enabling environment for women political participation through legal, policy and capacity building interventions.</narrative>
